=== SURVEY ===
cagg_fleet_stats is a regular MATERIALIZED VIEW (not TimescaleDB CAGG).
Created WITH NO DATA in migration 000142_baseline_typed.up.sql:1574.
Migration comment (line 1571): "refresh via maintenance worker calls REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW CONCURRENTLY cagg_fleet_stats"
But maintenance_worker.go has NO refresh call — that's the bug.

